b:
One thing I have to say about a certain character;  

If you are a support character, then ATTACK her. If you're healing a damage dealer and he starts being attacked by this character, stop healing and switch to your sidearm. She will go down quickly if you land even one headshot, but the damage dealer will struggle to outdamage her if he misses his abilities or has them on cooldown, even if you're healing or boosting him. The same is true of many other heroes.  

The support character's sidearm is so effective against this character that she is almost a counter.
